{
    "background_story": "Bitsy was a brilliant and reclusive author, known only by her pen name. She spent most of her life novelizing the stories of others, bringing to life the fantastical worlds and characters created by fellow writers. Her unique talent lay in her ability to immerse herself in the original material, breathing new life into the narratives. Bitsy's most famous work was the novelization of the popular video game series, 'Eternal Realms'. Her book adaptation stayed true to the spirit of the game while adding depth and complexity to the characters, making it a beloved companion to the gaming franchise. Despite her success, Bitsy remained an enigma, preferring the solitude of her writing studio to the spotlight. Her writing was her true self, and she poured her heart and soul into every novelization that bore her name.",
